 decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"1671\">","excerpt":"斗鱼把直播玩明白了","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":34,"created":1645173294,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1478044606663692288"},{"id":"1477070650560581632","title":"就你离谱....","content":"<p>就你离谱....</p><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-89fd07603a0b95d6ed1cd4111621d7fa_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"638\" height=\"948\">","excerpt":"就你离谱....","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":6,"created":1644941085,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1477070650560581632"},{"id":"1476623372364382210","title":"现在很多行业的逻辑是很清晰的... 你看上…","content":"<p>现在很多行业的逻辑是很清晰的...&lt;br&gt;你看上去是赛道之争，实际上则是计划和市场的交锋。</p>","excerpt":"现在很多行业的逻辑是很清晰的... 你看上…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":4,"created":1644834446,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1476623372364382210"},{"id":"1475086935627018240","title":"有人问到养老这事","content":"<p>有人问到养老这事。&lt;br&gt;我给大家讲个医养院吧。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;什么流程呢？&lt;br&gt;正规公立医院，走住院流程，行养老之实，然后家属每个月再出钱住进去就可以，护士看护，有病顺便就给医了。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;医院靠什么赚钱？&lt;br&gt;一部分是医保报销，一部分是家庭缴费。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;医保的钱从哪里来？ 所有年轻人&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;谁能住进去？反正不是老白姓....</p>","excerpt":"有人问到养老这事","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":5,"created":1644468131,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1475086935627018240"},{"id":"1473474307486085120","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-82a6a8b2adb725240d2dd8636bfc7ae1_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"840\" height=\"1304\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":12,"created":1644083650,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1473474307486085120"}]}